{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1000_p", "source_sha256": "33385e855fb0ab700d2f5675f34e214f7fae6f1291080b1e2eda27001694b3b4", "ja": "（今日は『アイグラ！！』の撮影。\nそろそろ志保の準備が終わる頃だと思うけど……）", "zh": "（今天是『アイグラ！！』的拍摄。我想志保差不多该准备好了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "cded3b581c26eca1ec511dfb5fc258e366d865ad709d2547511935f16f5aa47d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お待たせしました。\nあの、この衣装なんですけど……どうですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，让您久等了。\n那个，关于这身服装……您觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1b890557f35e1cf85ebcde0a6f862001be313cc70e223be5c1c2e4aeda987d76", "ja": "お疲れさま、志保！　うん、よく似合ってるな。\n志保にピッタリだと思う。", "zh": "辛苦了，志保！嗯，很适合你。\n我觉得特别适合志保。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "efbc16bba9fa1e5f87cb643e9366b35b85435ed322159de3eb5ec65c45307540", "ja": "そうなんですか？\n私に、ピッタリ……。", "zh": "是这样吗？\n很适合我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3504a3a3bcaccfe01005054bc5a115254469b9ac02fd4f1011941be7797c7a0a", "ja": "もしかして、違和感でもあるのか？", "zh": "难道说，有什么违和感吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "0736ae546edf404f190f16f7a3c4034dd180de8b0e02a9f8d36dbcb692777dda", "ja": "すこし。それに、自分がこの衣装を着るというのが、\nなんだかあまりピンとこなくて。", "zh": "有一点。而且，我总觉得自己穿上这身服装这件事，有些不太真实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5d10ae5cb0442d24f68280268c08c7fe132b0953c120f2507a79847519b1ba43", "ja": "白いワンピースは、アイドルの\nグラビア衣装としては、割と定番だと思うんだけど。", "zh": "我觉得白色连衣裙作为偶像的\n写真服装，应该算是比较经典的款式吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1007_p", "source_sha256": "eebea7ab304941b5ea16cf93a88fec6aa18a6cca1091af5e36e13518506cd34f", "ja": "志保も、劇場に置いてあるアイドル雑誌とかで\n見た事ないか？", "zh": "志保在剧场里放着的偶像杂志之类的上面，\n没见过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "b53a798d443c181fef9ba24ead310175970212da42ddb5a33da791557eb1b153", "ja": "そういう雑誌でなら、あります。\nでも、私とは違うタイプのアイドルというか……。", "zh": "如果是在那种杂志上的话，见过。\n不过，应该说是和我类型不同的偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "2145f5da64f40ed4bf9dd4b60c36679ada1586599decb2e4d1e22f1d1ddf8775", "ja": "草木の生い茂る森や、綺麗な浜辺で微笑んでいる……\nそういうイメージだったので。", "zh": "在草木茂盛的森林里，或者在美丽的海边微笑着……\n我印象中是那样的形象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1a650d62120ee1cb9f70ce637ee77b7d626e044dba3a52a7d51fc480041eb2e4", "ja": "ああ、なるほど。志保が、\n自分のイメージとは違うと思った、って事なんだな。", "zh": "啊，原来如此。也就是说，志保觉得这和自己的形象不太一样，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "a051d877aca74ad23d734676fe5bc9ce79da62b58c223af4d6ab59fffd9c817c", "ja": "はい。こういう衣装は、\n雪歩さんとかがよく着ているイメージなので。", "zh": "是的。因为在我的印象里，这种服装一般都是雪步前辈她们常穿的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "c08ad0a072f5009dbccccf9cae4930b1b8908cd6c989732e1493ba4a2b7d01b8", "ja": "どうして{$P$}さんは、\n私にこの衣装を選んだんだろうって思ってます。", "zh": "我在想，为什么{$P$}先生会为我挑选这套服装呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6e6331fed2494253c2e98a09582ca5e7497d2e6ffbc7d20ae3258b7eb3c9e816", "ja": "確かに、雪歩にはこういう衣装のイメージが\nあるかもしれないな。", "zh": "确实，雪歩给人的印象\n可能就是这类风格的衣装吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "def5f1e659571ffe9c7d563d59322d7367def52100efdcb7e046929811bed2d8", "ja": "だったら……。", "zh": "既然这样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9c6ec03f88a991dec85dc6154f70c6d5a52d12d52934817136e4ee2b51b60ddb", "ja": "でも、例えばだけど。先月のグラビアで\n白いワンピースを着たのは、エレナなんだ。意外だろ？", "zh": "不过，只是举个例子。上个月的写真里穿白色连衣裙的人，是艾蕾娜。很意外吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "bf4720f57f411cdd5e86f0b4488bb46b22fa067abb82b9bf4d0d89fb80765364", "ja": "エレナさん、ですか？\n……そうですね。たしかに、ちょっと意外ですけど。", "zh": "是艾莲娜吗？\n……这么说来，确实有点出人意料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "e36b93c3b9ca1391a5459ab6f68bbff6ee73a99f9cf7536def2f27ee8192d838", "ja": "でも、エレナさんなら似合うんじゃないでしょうか。\n雪歩さんとは違ったイメージで……あっ。", "zh": "不过，如果是艾蕾娜的话，应该很合适吧。\n和雪步小姐给人的感觉不同……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "90287bb7dd3ef0c59facb982a5aac5b515c3b4c28c606bd9ae8e2b07fa1ec217", "ja": "もしかして……同じ衣装でも、\n求められているものが違う……？", "zh": "难道说……即使是同一套服装，\n被要求展现出来的东西也不同……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1019_p", "source_sha256": "48b236e0db99739261dd61dfea90509eff6c0db9e459b0b7bcfc24e5d14e5397", "ja": "そういう事かな？　だから志保も、自分のイメージに\nこだわらず、チャレンジしてみて欲しい。", "zh": "是这样吗？所以志保也不要拘泥于自己的形象，试着挑战一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1020_p", "source_sha256": "98090aa63b321524487e971712bbca6e733d3929c7f3e66f4a42348a7d36c360", "ja": "その方がきっと、仕事の幅も広がると思うんだ。", "zh": "我觉得那样肯定也能拓宽你的工作范围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "a6ef82c107446988a36c88fa567385229eda6a300b085b9442b51d8b82fca190", "ja": "仕事の幅が……。\nそうですか、わかりました。", "zh": "工作的范围……  \n这样啊，我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "6a38373239fa99ed2d715477328d9a0dcd86b79ae42137e61cd27e8c3d3488e7", "ja": "アドバイスありがとうございます、\n{$P$}さん。がんばってみます。", "zh": "谢谢你的建议，{$P$}先生。我会努力试试的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0223_1023_p", "source_sha256": "80bb6742509c436683636bca0b190f597106e394e4f0f32a991a36dd88268af0", "ja": "（志保の表情が引き締まる。目的意識のはっきりした\n志保なら、期待通りの結果を出してくれるだろう）", "zh": "（志保的表情变得严肃起来。像她这样目标明确，一定能交出符合期待的成果吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
